{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0342_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0342_1000_p", "source_sha256": "102c8e7ad2be8e94b1c82c2fea24910febb267a9bf7db7ce1512b349992d9345", "ja": "（春香とドラマの撮影に来ている。文化祭で演劇をする\nシーンのため、今は熱心に役作りをしているようだ）", "zh": "（我和春香一起来拍电视剧。为了文化祭上演话剧的场景，她现在好像正在认真地揣摩角色。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0342_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0342_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "5c54d05ec53bfde8733c1aa20cf9481078a96f0511a97c55cefd3358c83d2edf", "ja": "「もしダメだったとしても、今より悪くなる\nわけじゃないでしょ！」……うん、こんな感じかな♪", "zh": "“就算没成功，也不会比现在更糟吧！”……嗯，大概就是这种感觉吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0342_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0342_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3e9afb858b0a23e94186608767bd9427b69ed6290699ac79f6788f75da7ccc7e", "ja": "演劇シーンでやる『オズの魔法使い』のセリフか。\nしっかり役に入り込めてるみたいだな。", "zh": "原来是演剧场景里要演的《绿野仙踪》的台词啊。看来已经完全进入角色了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0342_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0342_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "bb1b5e918b9ba6b7467a9e9ca525d9635652c56934ed6969722222081a2d3d06", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！　知ってましたか？\nドロシーって、頭が良くてしっかり者で、凄いんです！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！您知道吗？\n多萝茜既聪明又能干，真的很厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0342_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0342_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "f414cf23e3823701a5aa6788e180cae2938ce42e141fc5dc1a2b5a41ac9816aa", "ja": "どんなことがあっても前向きで……。演じてて、\n私もドロシーみたいになりたいなって思いました。", "zh": "无论发生什么事都能保持积极……演着演着，我也觉得自己想变得像多萝茜一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0342_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0342_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2105d4905ae6c812fcc3a5a50407b781f9d27167c819e8ba6f980de927dccce6", "ja": "なるほど、前向きか。春香ならきっとなれるよ。\n前向きなところ、すごく似てると思う。", "zh": "原来如此，是积极向上啊。春香一定能成为那样的人。\n我觉得你积极向上的地方，真的和她很像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0342_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0342_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "b42b51a8f7de3584e43ec2c563da59579eb8c57c5f4728a996ca2d92b6f07809", "ja": "えへへ、そう言われたら本当に\nドロシーになれる気がしてきちゃいますね♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，你这么一说，我真的觉得自己好像能成为多萝茜了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0342_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0342_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "20e199d8ca38349eacf37b2a035021e86ad4dbf91336f0cab40b6153d591aad2", "ja": "あれ……？　頭が良くてしっかり者なところは……？", "zh": "咦……？那聪明又靠谱的部分呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0342_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0342_1008_p", "source_sha256": "01475e250582d2d55e884bdd3bf1661126a442d852e07f58d4fc12207a276eb3", "ja": "あー……春香には春香の、ドロシーにはドロシーの\nいいところがあるからな！　前向き最高！　春香最高！", "zh": "啊——……春香有春香的，桃乐丝也有桃乐丝的\n优点嘛！积极向上最棒了！春香最棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0342_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0342_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "a2d7937919e1643d8ff0cb2443c28311766c4eaaa483061234d5e3693782219d", "ja": "あ！　そ、そうですね？　ありがとうございます！\nよーし、前向きにがんばるぞー！　……んんー？", "zh": "啊！是、是这样吗？非常感谢！\n好～，我会积极努力的——！……嗯～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
